<title>USA: TABLE-Merit Holding Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Merit Holding Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>TUCKER, Ga. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Months</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		  $0.23		    $0.20</p>
<p> Net		  $1,050,485	     $863,150</p>
<p>	  6 Months</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.44		    $0.39</p>
<p> Net		 $1,983,333	     $1,687,853</p>
<p> Total Assets    $239,286,104	   $216,504,054</p>
<p> Total Loans     $160,766,683	   $141,095,721</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company says first half earnings are a company record.</p>
<p>--  At June 30, the allowance for loan losses was $2,967,045, or 1.81 percent of loans outstanding, compared with $2,847,010, or 1.98 percent of loans outstanding during the same period last year.</p>
